  "content": "<h2>分步指南：使用 Rancher RKE2 和 Longhorn 构建生产 Kubernetes 集群</h2><div style=\"margin: 2rem 0; text-align: center;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 400\" width=\"800\" height=\"400\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"k8s-bg\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#E8EAF6\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#E3F2FD\"/></linearGradient><marker id=\"k8s-arrow\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"7\" refX=\"10\" refY=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\"><polygon points=\"0 0, 10 3.5, 0 7\" fill=\"#326CE5\"/></marker></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"400\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"url(#k8s-bg)\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1A237E\">Kubernetes 集群架构 (RKE2)</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"65\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#326CE5\">控制平面节点</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"80\" width=\"130\" height=\"120\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#326CE5\" stroke=\"#1A237E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">节点 1（领导者）</text><rect x=\"62\" y=\"112\" width=\"106\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#5C8EE6\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"128\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">API 服务器</text><rect x=\"62\" y=\"138\" width=\"106\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#5C8EE6\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">etcd</text><rect x=\"62\" y=\"164\" width=\"106\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#5C8EE6\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">调度程序</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"80\" width=\"130\" height=\"120\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#326CE5\" stroke=\"#1A237E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"265\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">节点 2</text><rect x=\"212\" y=\"112\" width=\"106\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#5C8EE6\"/><text x=\"265\" y=\"128\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">API 服务器</text><rect x=\"212\" y=\"138\" width=\"106\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#5C8EE6\"/><text x=\"265\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">etcd</text><rect x=\"212\" y=\"164\" width=\"106\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#5C8EE6\"/><text x=\"265\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">控制器管理器</text><rect x=\"350\" y=\"80\" width=\"130\" height=\"120\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#326CE5\" stroke=\"#1A237E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"415\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">节点 3</text><rect x=\"362\" y=\"112\" width=\"106\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#5C8EE6\"/><text x=\"415\" y=\"128\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">API 服务器</text><rect x=\"362\" y=\"138\" width=\"106\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#5C8EE6\"/><text x=\"415\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">etcd</text><rect x=\"362\" y=\"164\" width=\"106\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#5C8EE6\"/><text x=\"415\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">控制器管理器</text><text x=\"630\" y=\"65\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1B5E20\">工作线程节点</text><rect x=\"530\" y=\"80\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" stroke=\"#1B5E20\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"590\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">工作线程 1</text><rect x=\"542\" y=\"112\" width=\"96\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#66BB6A\"/><text x=\"590\" y=\"128\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">kubelet</text><rect x=\"542\" y=\"138\" width=\"96\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#66BB6A\"/><text x=\"590\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">kube-proxy</text><rect x=\"542\" y=\"164\" width=\"96\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#66BB6A\"/><text x=\"590\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">Pod</text><rect x=\"670\" y=\"80\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" stroke=\"#1B5E20\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"730\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">工作线程 2</text><rect x=\"682\" y=\"112\" width=\"96\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#66BB6A\"/><text x=\"730\" y=\"128\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">kubelet</text><rect x=\"682\" y=\"138\" width=\"96\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#66BB6A\"/><text x=\"730\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">kube-proxy</text><rect x=\"682\" y=\"164\" width=\"96\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#66BB6A\"/><text x=\"730\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">Pod</text><line x1=\"480\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"530\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#326CE5\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#k8s-arrow)\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"230\" width=\"500\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#FFA726\" stroke=\"#E65100\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">Canal CNI 网络层（Pod 到 Pod 通信）</text><line x1=\"265\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"230\" stroke=\"#FFA726\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,3\"/><line x1=\"590\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"230\" stroke=\"#FFA726\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,3\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"310\" width=\"500\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#7E57C2\" stroke=\"#4527A0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"340\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">Longhorn 分布式存储层</text><line x1=\"400\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"310\" stroke=\"#7E57C2\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#k8s-arrow)\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"390\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#616161\" font-style=\"italic\">HA 配置，具有 3 个控制平面节点和自动故障转移</text></svg></div><h3>步骤 1：安装 RKE2</h3><ol><li>从 Rancher 官方网站下载 RKE2 安装程序。</li><li>在每个节点上运行<code>curl -sfL https://get.rke2.io | sh -</code>。</li><li>启动RKE2服务：<code>systemctl enable rke2-server &amp;&amp; systemctl start rke2-server</code></li></ol><h3>步骤 2：部署 Longhorn 用于存储</h3><div style=\"margin: 2rem 0; text-align: center;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 400\" width=\"800\" height=\"400\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"lh-bg\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#F3E5F5\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#E8EAF6\"/></linearGradient><marker id=\"lh-arrow\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"7\" refX=\"10\" refY=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\"><polygon points=\"0 0, 10 3.5, 0 7\" fill=\"#7E57C2\"/></marker></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"400\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"url(#lh-bg)\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#4527A0\">Longhorn 分布式存储集成</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"55\" width=\"130\" height=\"55\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#326CE5\" stroke=\"#1A237E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"145\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">应用程序 Pod A</text><text x=\"145\" y=\"98\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\">PVC 声明</text><rect x=\"250\" y=\"55\" width=\"130\" height=\"55\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#326CE5\" stroke=\"#1A237E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"315\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">应用程序 Pod B</text><text x=\"315\" y=\"98\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\">PVC 声明</text><rect x=\"420\" y=\"55\" width=\"130\" height=\"55\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#326CE5\" stroke=\"#1A237E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"485\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">应用程序 Pod C</text><text x=\"485\" y=\"98\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\">PVC 声明</text><rect x=\"610\" y=\"55\" width=\"130\" height=\"55\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#326CE5\" stroke=\"#1A237E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"675\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">StatefulSet</text><text x=\"675\" y=\"98\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\">PVC 声明</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"140\" width=\"400\" height=\"55\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#7E57C2\" stroke=\"#4527A0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">Longhorn CSI 驱动器和引擎</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#E1BEE7\">容量调度和复制管理器</text><line x1=\"145\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#7E57C2\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#lh-arrow)\"/><line x1=\"315\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#7E57C2\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#lh-arrow)\"/><line x1=\"485\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#7E57C2\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#lh-arrow)\"/><line x1=\"675\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#7E57C2\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#lh-arrow)\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"230\" width=\"200\" height=\"130\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" stroke=\"#1B5E20\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"258\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">工作节点 1</text><rect x=\"75\" y=\"268\" width=\"170\" height=\"25\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#66BB6A\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"286\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">副本 A1 和副本 A1 B1</text><rect x=\"75\" y=\"300\" width=\"170\" height=\"25\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#81C784\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"318\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">SSD 存储</text><rect x=\"75\" y=\"332\" width=\"170\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#A5D6A7\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"347\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1B5E20\">iSCSI 目标</text><rect x=\"300\" y=\"230\" width=\"200\" height=\"130\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" stroke=\"#1B5E20\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"258\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">工作节点 2</text><rect x=\"315\" y=\"268\" width=\"170\" height=\"25\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#66BB6A\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"286\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">副本 A2 和 B1 C1</text><rect x=\"315\" y=\"300\" width=\"170\" height=\"25\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#81C784\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"318\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">SSD 存储</text><rect x=\"315\" y=\"332\" width=\"170\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#A5D6A7\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"347\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1B5E20\">iSCSI 目标</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"230\" width=\"200\" height=\"130\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" stroke=\"#1B5E20\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"640\" y=\"258\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">工作节点 3</text><rect x=\"555\" y=\"268\" width=\"170\" height=\"25\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#66BB6A\"/><text x=\"640\" y=\"286\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">副本 B2 和 C1 C2</text><rect x=\"555\" y=\"300\" width=\"170\" height=\"25\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#81C784\"/><text x=\"640\" y=\"318\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">SSD 存储</text><rect x=\"555\" y=\"332\" width=\"170\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#A5D6A7\"/><text x=\"640\" y=\"347\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1B5E20\">iSCSI 目标</text><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"195\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"230\" stroke=\"#7E57C2\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#lh-arrow)\"/><line x1=\"400\" y1=\"195\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"230\" stroke=\"#7E57C2\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#lh-arrow)\"/><line x1=\"500\" y1=\"195\" x2=\"640\" y2=\"230\" stroke=\"#7E57C2\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#lh-arrow)\"/><line x1=\"260\" y1=\"295\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"295\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4,3\"/><line x1=\"500\" y1=\"295\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"295\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4,3\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"390\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#616161\" font-style=\"italic\">每个卷都跨节点复制，以实现高可用性</text></svg></div><ol><li>安装 Helm：<code>curl https://raw.githubusercontent.com/helm/helm/master/scripts/get-helm-3 | bash</code></li><li>添加 Longhorn 存储库：<code>helm repo add longhorn https://charts.longhorn.io</code></li><li>安装 Longhorn：<code>helm install longhorn longhorn/longhorn --namespace longhorn-system --create-namespace</code></li></ol><h3>架构图</h3><img src='/img/ai-neural-network.jpg' alt='Kubernetes Cluster Architecture Diagram' style='max-width:100%;margin:2em 0;'/><h3>技术说明</h3><ul><li>使用 SSD 存储以获得最佳性能。</li><li>确保所有节点都有唯一的主机名和静态 IP。</li><li>配置防火墙以允许 Kubernetes 端口。</li></ul><h3>如何：验证集群运行状况</h3><pre><code>kubectl get nodes\nkubectl get pods -A\nkubectl get storageclass</code></pre><h3>最佳 YouTube 视频指南</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bhBSlnQcq2g' target='_blank'>Kubernetes 初学者教程 [TechWorld with Nana]</a></li><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VnvRrz9fK_U' target='_blank'>Kubernetes 完整课程 - 8 小时学会 Kubernetes | Kubernetes教程| Edureka</a></li><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vw1h8ZNmFvA' target='_blank'>Rancher RKE2 Kubernetes 集群设置 [Rancher Labs]</a></li><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qn3jYj8pQjA' target='_blank'>用于 Kubernetes 的 Longhorn 存储 [TechWorld with Nana]</a></li><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PH-2FfFD2PU' target='_blank'>Kubernetes 15 分钟解释[学术界]</a></li><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7bA0gTroJjw' target='_blank'>Kubernetes 网络深入探究 [Google 云技术]</a></li><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qn3jYj8pQjA' target='_blank'>用于 Kubernetes 的 Longhorn 存储 [TechWorld with Nana]</a></li><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KqvK5K3nR6A' target='_blank'>Kubernetes 安全最佳实践 [TechWorld with Nana]</a></li></ul><h3>视频演练</h3><iframe width='560' height='315' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/bhBSlnQcq2g' title='Kubernetes Setup Demo' frameborder='0' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture' allowfullscreen></iframe><br/><iframe width='560' height='315' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/VnvRrz9fK_U' title='Kubernetes Full Course' frameborder='0' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture' allowfullscreen></iframe><br/><iframe width='560' height='315' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/Vw1h8ZNmFvA' title='Rancher RKE2 Kubernetes Cluster Setup' frameborder='0' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture' allowfullscreen></iframe><br/><iframe width='560' height='315' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/Qn3jYj8pQjA' title='Longhorn Storage for Kubernetes' frameborder='0' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture' allowfullscreen></iframe><br/><iframe width='560' height='315' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/PH-2FfFD2PU' title='Kubernetes Explained in 15 Minutes' frameborder='0' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture' allowfullscreen></iframe><br/><iframe width='560' height='315' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/7bA0gTroJjw' title='Kubernetes Networking Deep Dive' frameborder='0' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture' allowfullscreen></iframe><br/><iframe width='560' height='315' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/KqvK5K3nR6A' title='Kubernetes Security Best Practices' frameborder='0' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture' allowfullscreen></iframe><h3>额外资源</h3><ul><li><a href='https://rancher.com/docs/rke2/latest/zh/' target='_blank'>Rancher RKE2 官方文档</a></li><li><a href='https://longhorn.io/docs/' target='_blank'>Longhorn 存储官方文档</a></li><li><a href='https://kubernetes.io/docs/home/' target='_blank'>Kubernetes 官方文档</a></li></ul><h3>常见问题和</h3>故障排除<ul><li>节点未加入：检查防火墙和令牌。</li><li>Longhorn Pod 未运行：验证存储类别和节点标签。</li><li>网络问题：检查 CNI 插件配置。</li></ul>",
